# Agent 0.0.30 publication

Agent 0.0.30 was published and registry-confirmed on 2026-10-11 from verified main at ee734c30151c7d431e480aff7a0d54306d387f13. The user authorized the upload independently of subsequent experiment decisions. No package or source bytes changed after verification.

The successful publish runner exited 0 uncapped in 77708 ms. A separate npm registry read confirmed version 0.0.30 and the archive identity below. The initial registry E404 during processing resolved without another upload. A preceding attempt exited 3 with EOTP and did not publish; user codes and authentication files are excluded from this record.

