The fresh package was compared byte for byte with the retained release archive before upload. Registry SHA-1 and integrity match that verified archive. Release gates passed 1857 tests with 2 applicability skips, recorded replay 108/108, and a raw comparison of 618 requests per build with no differences. These are the standing measurements detailed in [the release checkpoint](release-checkpoint.md), not newly rerun gates.

The completed release worktree was removed after its clean state and resolved workspace path were verified. Historical dependency-junction cleanup was not retried. The primary agent checkout remains on main.

Desk's gauge migration and packed-artifact proofs are complete. Published dependency pins, lockfile refresh and published-package checks remain pending the owner-authorized X2-compatible Ollama release. The registry reading on 2026-10-11 served Ollama 0.0.22 with agent ^0.0.29. The [X2 patch](consumers/ollama-x2.patch) and [packed identities](consumers/packed-hashes.json) remain available for its owner. This record claims no Ollama publication or desk default-branch update.
